    "Description": "Deals earth damage with a potency of 250 to all nearby enemies.\n\n※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460358,
    "RowId": 789,
    "Description": "Decreases damage suffered by pet by 20%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\"> 20s\nWhen <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Obey</span> is active, will only execute upon command."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460534,
    "RowId": 790,
    "Description": "Deals earth damage with a potency of 70.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\"> Stun\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\"> 2s\nWhen <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Obey</span> is active, will only execute upon command."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 460766,
    "RowId": 791,
    "Description": "Deals earth damage with a potency of 300 to all nearby targets.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Creates an area of molten earth around the caster, dealing damage to any enemies who enter\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Potency:</span> 20 <span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">\nDuration:</span> 15s\n\n※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 461114,
    "RowId": 792,
    "Description": "Deals wind damage with a potency of 30 to target and all enemies nearby it.\n\n※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 461254,
    "RowId": 793,
    "Description": "Deals wind damage with a potency of 90.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\"> 15-yalm knockback\nWhen <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Obey</span> is active, will only execute upon command."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 461454,
